# DET-005 – Multiple Failed Logons

## Purpose
Detect multiple failed Windows logon attempts within a short period of time.

## MITRE ATT&CK
Credential Access (Brute Force)

## Data Source
- Windows Security Event Log
- Event ID 4625

## Detection Logic

```spl
index=windows sourcetype="XmlWinEventLog:Security" "<EventID>4625</EventID>"
| bin _time span=5m
| stats count AS FailedAttempts BY _time host
| where FailedAttempts >= 3
```

## Expected Benign Activity
- User mistyping a password
- Recently changed passwords
- Cached credentials
- Service accounts using an outdated password

## Potentially Suspicious Activity
- Password spraying
- Brute-force attempts
- Repeated authentication failures from the same endpoint

